<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 281 0 R
/T (The project began with the observation that competitive-exam aspirants repeatedly practise using the same limited set of static question banks, and that a generative AI model could remove this constraint by producing fresh, syllabus-aligned questions on demand. The developer evaluated technical feasibility by reviewing the Google Gemini Generative AI API documentation, the constraints of running a live countdown timer inside a Streamlit app via session state and streamlit-autorefresh, and the suitability of pdfplumber / python-docx for extracting study material. The inception phase concluded with a defined project idea, a chosen technology stack \(Python, Streamlit, Gemini API, SQLite\) and a preliminary feature list. )
/E (The project began with the observation that competitive-exam aspirants repeatedly practise using the same limited set of static question banks, and that a generative AI model could remove this constraint by producing fresh, syllabus-aligned questions on demand. The developer evaluated technical feasibility by reviewing the Google Gemini Generative AI API documentation, the constraints of running a live countdown timer inside a Streamlit app via session state and streamlit-autorefresh, and the suitability of pdfplumber / python-docx for extracting study material. The inception phase concluded with a defined project idea, a chosen technology stack \(Python, Streamlit, Gemini API, SQLite\) and a preliminary feature list. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
