452 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 282 0 R
/T (After reviewing the full feature list against the available development time and the limitations of a single-user, local Streamlit deployment, several features were deliberately excluded from the current version. These include user registration and login, admin accounts, a cloud-hosted multi-user database, online payment, social login, live multiplayer examinations, webcam-based proctoring and advanced anti-cheating mechanisms. The features retained for this version are exam configuration, study-material processing, AI question generation, the CBT examination engine, scoring and analytics, and local SQLite- based test history. This scope reduction keeps the project deliverable within the academic timeline while still demonstrating the complete, realistic mock-test experience end to end. )
/E (After reviewing the full feature list against the available development time and the limitations of a single-user, local Streamlit deployment, several features were deliberately excluded from the current version. These include user registration and login, admin accounts, a cloud-hosted multi-user database, online payment, social login, live multiplayer examinations, webcam-based proctoring and advanced anti-cheating mechanisms. The features retained for this version are exam configuration, study-material processing, AI question generation, the CBT examination engine, scoring and analytics, and local SQLite- based test history. This scope reduction keeps the project deliverable within the academic timeline while still demonstrating the complete, realistic mock-test experience end to end. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
