/T (Validation is carried out through functional testing of each module individually \(configuration validation, material extraction, Gemini question generation and JSON parsing, timer behaviour, scoring formulas\), integration testing of the complete flow from configuration through to result and history, and informal user-acceptance testing by attempting full mock tests across more than one examination and difficulty combination. Each test verifies that the system behaves according to its specification, including correct negative-marking deductions, accurate accuracy calculation, proper palette-state transitions and a correctly saved history record. Defects such as malformed Gemini JSON responses are handled by surfacing a Try Again option rather than crashing the session. )
/E (Validation is carried out through functional testing of each module individually \(configuration validation, material extraction, Gemini question generation and JSON parsing, timer behaviour, scoring formulas\), integration testing of the complete flow from configuration through to result and history, and informal user-acceptance testing by attempting full mock tests across more than one examination and difficulty combination. Each test verifies that the system behaves according to its specification, including correct negative-marking deductions, accurate accuracy calculation, proper palette-state transitions and a correctly saved history record. Defects such as malformed Gemini JSON responses are handled by surfacing a Try Again option rather than crashing the session. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [9]
>>
