923 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 301 0 R
/T (The project aims to develop a web-based mock-test platform that helps competitive-exam aspirants practise using AI-generated questions inside a realistic Computer-Based Test \(CBT\) interface. The system allows an aspirant to configure an examination, subject and difficulty, supply study material or request AI research, generate questions using the Google Gemini Generative AI API, attempt a timed exam, receive a score with section-wise analytics and explanations, and review historical attempts stored locally in SQLite. )
/E (The project aims to develop a web-based mock-test platform that helps competitive-exam aspirants practise using AI-generated questions inside a realistic Computer-Based Test \(CBT\) interface. The system allows an aspirant to configure an examination, subject and difficulty, supply study material or request AI research, generate questions using the Google Gemini Generative AI API, attempt a timed exam, receive a score with section-wise analytics and explanations, and review historical attempts stored locally in SQLite. )
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
