/E (ADataFlowDiagram\(DFD\)isagraphical representation of data movement within a system.Itconsistsofexternalentities,processes, data stores and data flows. A Context Level DFDprovidesanoverviewoftheentiresystem as a single process. A Data Dictionary definesthestructureofdataelementsandtheir relationships. DFDs help visualise how data movesthroughdifferentpartsofthesystem, making it easier to identify inefficiencies and areas for optimisation.)
