/T (The session begins in the Config state, moves to Generating Questions once the aspirant requests a test, and returns to Config if generation fails so that the aspirant can retry. On success it moves to In Progress, where the aspirant attempts questions until the exam is Submitted \(manually or by timer expiry\). The session is then Evaluated and the result is shown, before finally being Saved to History in the local SQLite database. )
/E (The session begins in the Config state, moves to Generating Questions once the aspirant requests a test, and returns to Config if generation fails so that the aspirant can retry. On success it moves to In Progress, where the aspirant attempts questions until the exam is Submitted \(manually or by timer expiry\). The session is then Evaluated and the result is shown, before finally being Saved to History in the local SQLite database. )
/Pg 56 0 R
/K [12]
