/P 322 0 R
/T (This is the sequence diagram for the AI Mock Test Generator, showing how the Aspirant, the Streamlit UI, ExamConfig, AIQuestionGenerator, the Gemini API, ExamSession, ScoringEngine and the SQLite database interact over the course of a single mock-test attempt. The aspirant first configures the exam, the UI requests question generation from Gemini through AIQuestionGenerator, the generated questions are loaded into an ExamSession, the aspirant attempts and submits the exam, ScoringEngine evaluates the answers, and finally the ResultRecord is saved to SQLite and the result is displayed back to the aspirant. )
/E (This is the sequence diagram for the AI Mock Test Generator, showing how the Aspirant, the Streamlit UI, ExamConfig, AIQuestionGenerator, the Gemini API, ExamSession, ScoringEngine and the SQLite database interact over the course of a single mock-test attempt. The aspirant first configures the exam, the UI requests question generation from Gemini through AIQuestionGenerator, the generated questions are loaded into an ExamSession, the aspirant attempts and submits the exam, ScoringEngine evaluates the answers, and finally the ResultRecord is saved to SQLite and the result is displayed back to the aspirant. )
/Pg 56 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
