/Title (difficulty tag. The application then loads these questions into a full CBT examination interface built with Streamlit session state, runs a live countdown timer using streamlit- autorefresh, records every answer along with its visited / marked-for-review state, evaluates the attempt on submission \(manual or automatic on time-out\), computes the score, accuracy and a section-wise breakdown, displays detailed explanations for every question, and finally stores a summary of the attempt in a local SQLite database \(mocktest_history.db\) so that the aspirant can review historical performance and a score-progression chart.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4324 0 R
/Prev 4334 0 R
>>
