4371 0 obj
<<
/Title (The exam-configuration screen must respond immediately to user input, since no server round-trip is required at this stage. Question generation is bounded chiefly by the response time of the Gemini Generative AI API and by network conditions; the interface displays a clear loading state while this call is in progress and offers a Try Again option if generation fails. Once questions are loaded, navigation between questions, answer selection, marking for review and palette updates must feel instantaneous, since these operations only update local Streamlit session state. The live countdown timer must refresh every second using streamlit-autorefresh without perceptibly slowing down the rest of the interface. Score calculation, section-wise analysis and the writing of a result record to SQLite must complete within a short, unnoticeable interval immediately after submission.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4360 0 R
>>
endobj
