4405 0 obj
<<
/Title (The project began with the observation that competitive-exam aspirants repeatedly practise using the same limited set of static question banks, and that a generative AI model could remove this constraint by producing fresh, syllabus-aligned questions on demand. The developer evaluated technical feasibility by reviewing the Google Gemini Generative AI API documentation, the constraints of running a live countdown timer inside a Streamlit app via session state and streamlit-autorefresh, and the suitability of pdfplumber / python-docx for extracting study material. The inception phase concluded with a defined project idea, a chosen technology stack \(Python, Streamlit, Gemini API, SQLite\) and a preliminary feature list.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4394 0 R
>>
endobj
